  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">El d&uacute;o T&agrave;ndem, formado por Maria Igual a la voz y Luis Beltr&aacute;n a la guitarra, ha protagonizado la tarde de este s&aacute;bado en la plaza de Espa&ntilde;a la segunda sesi&oacute;n de la III edici&oacute;n de Onda, Espais de Jazz.</span></span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/07/IMG_1916.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">El pr&oacute;ximo s&aacute;bado, 26 de julio, nuevamente en la Font de Dins, ser&aacute; el turno de Pau Viguer Tr&iacute;o.</span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jazztandemplacaespanya190714/img_1914.jpg\" alt=\"img_1914\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jazztandemplacaespanya190714/img_1916.jpg\" alt=\"img_1916\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jazztandemplacaespanya190714/img_1917.jpg\" alt=\"img_1917\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jazztandemplacaespanya190714/img_1918.jpg\" alt=\"img_1918\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jazztandemplacaespanya190714/img_1919.jpg\" alt=\"img_1919\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jazztandemplacaespanya190714/img_1920.jpg\" alt=\"img_1920\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jazztandemplacaespanya190714/img_1922.jpg\" alt=\"img_1922\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=